OL,3,GNEWSACalls to halt cycle bridge plan in
OL,4,ARoman village
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a hamlet that dates back
OL,7,Fto Roman times are calling for plans to
OL,8,Finstall a cycle lane on their Grade-II
OL,9,Flisted bridge to be halted.
OL,11,FNorthumberland County Council is to
OL,12,Freduce the two-lane traffic flow on
OL,13,FDilston Bridge in Corbridge to a single
OL,14,Flane, install traffic lights either
OL,15,Fside and use the newly-created space
OL,16,Ffor the cycle path.
OL,18,FSome locals say the plans risk
OL,19,F"urbanising" and "changing the
OL,20,Fcharacter" of the village and cause
OL,21,Fcongestion by creating a traffic
OL,22,Fbottleneck.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
