OL,3,GNEWSACalls to halt cycle bridge plan in
OL,4,ARoman village
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners want a heritage
OL,7,Fconsultation over the plan, but the
OL,8,Fcouncil said it was not required and
OL,9,Fthe bridge itself was not being altered
OL,10,For demolished.
